# state.pdl - every file rmmc may leave beside its book, and what kind of fact it is (no ghost data, owner 2026-11-07).
# Each row names the line I saw it written at (2026-11-25 review, plan section 5 item 1).
# FILE | name | kind | writer | regenerate_with
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0000/ | PROJECTION | rmmc_field_op writes cells.rgba (rmmc_field_op.c:95 to :99), cells.txt (:101), map.txt (:103), extrusion.pdl (:125), events.txt (:131, emptied), cells.marker (:133, APPENDS one byte per run: it grows, so it is not a pure projection; restart it on regenerate), skin.txt (:135) | rmmc_field_op <tileset_dir> <desk_dir>
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0001/ | PROJECTION | rmmc_scale_op makes it from the centroid small page; rmmc_biome_op repaints cells.txt, map.txt, extrusion.pdl, legend.txt, cells.rgba, events.txt (empty), cells.marker (size = old mod 4000 + 1) from biomes.pdl (2026-11-25) | rmmc_scale_op <centroid small> <desk> 3 then rmmc_biome_op biomes.pdl <desk>
FILE | biomes.pdl | CONFIG | hand-edited biome rows (the only place the island numbers live); never written by an op | none
# 2026-11-25 Asa walks on the island (D137): the vox ledger is the ONLY authority; the seed island is a CONFIG; the desk folder is the PROJECTION the engine reads.
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0001/seed/ | CONFIG | rmmc_scale_op then rmmc_biome_op paint it (run them ON this folder: since 2026-11-25 the authored island lives here); copied from the desk folder once; never written by the game, never read back from the projection | rmmc_scale_op <centroid small> <seed> 3 then rmmc_biome_op biomes.pdl <seed>
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0001/{cells.txt,map.txt,events.txt} | PROJECTION | rmmc_project_op writes them atomically from the seed folded with the ledger (the earlier row above that named this folder as written by the biome op is superseded: the biome op now paints seed/) | rmmc_project_op project <seed> <desk> <ledger> pose.pdl vox/terrain.heightmap
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0001/cells.marker | PROJECTION | rmmc_project_op: size = old size mod 4000 + 1 (grows on every projection; the engine reloads the desk on a SIZE change; not byte-identical on regenerate, it restarts at 1) | rmmc_project_op (delete it and it restarts)
FILE | rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rmmc/rmmc-0001/{extrusion.pdl,legend.txt,cells.rgba,skin.txt,rig_*.pdl} | PROJECTION | rmmc_project_op copies them from seed/ when they differ (the engine reads this folder) | rmmc_project_op
FILE | EDIT state/games/rmmc/game/ledger.txt | LEDGER | vox_op verbs move walk face jump reset seat (and later mine place) append rows via rmmc_verb; the path is RMMC_LEDGER or this default (rmmc_verb.c); NOT the shared #.desktop/vox_ledger.txt. Rows: MOVE FACE RESET SEAT GIVE DAMAGE MINE DROP PLACE TURN | - (the ledger is the authority; never delete, never hand-edit: verify refuses with 14)
FILE | vox/terrain.heightmap | CONFIG | generated by rmmc_heightmap_op from seed/ (never edited, never written by the game) | rmmc_heightmap_op build <seed> heightmap.pdl vox/terrain.heightmap
FILE | vox/rules.pdl, vox/blocks.pdl, vox/terrain.pdl, heightmap.pdl, pose.pdl, keys.pdl, beats.pdl, verbs.pdl, rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl | CONFIG | hand-edited numbers and rows; read by vox_op, rmmc_heightmap_op, rmmc_project_op, rmmc_driver, rmmc_beat_op | none
FILE | events/<verb>/ | CONFIG | verbgen gen from verbs.pdl (a page runs rmmc_verb) | verbgen gen @.apps/rmmc
FILE | play/result.txt (beside this book) | PROJECTION | rmmc_verb writes "ok" or "refused: <reason> [exit N]" after each verb | deleted any time
FILE | play/beat.txt (beside this book) | PREFERENCE | rmmc_beat_op writes the number of the last beat played: only a bookmark that picks which row `next` plays, it never changes an outcome | deleted any time (next starts at beat 1)
FILE | EDIT state/game_ui.txt (the --feed path) | PROJECTION | rmmc_driver writes it only when its bytes change (who, where, the seat, the last message) | rewritten by the driver
